Z||000000||dlancer407||07-05-2001||05:44 PM||||Hi All ; Well I picked up my 85 GT from Walker Pontiac in Cincinnati today. They had it for one week doing the V6 recall work that had never been done. I have to say these guys were great. No hassels and they did a very good job on my car. I am so impressed with them I may take my car to them for any other services I may need.Man I missed that little car for that week.<BR>||||reg||14
