Z||000006||dlancer407||07-06-2001||03:38 PM||||I found out about the recall at the Michigan Fiero web site. They have all recalls on there site. You can print them out. The one covering V6 engine fires is Twelve pages long. I then took my car to a Pontiac dealer but when they ran the vin # it came back no open recalls on my car. The service Mgr. said that there computer only goes back Ten years. I then called Pontiac customer service and they could not find my car. The  lady said I should take my car back to the dealer to have them visualy inspect the car to see if the work had ever been done.They decided it had not and they ordered the parts.||||reg||7
